<title>USA: Equity Residential Q1 share rises.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential Q1 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.46		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			 32,962		   18,394</p>
<p> Revs		     141,387		  106,321</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  51,791		   37,887</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Funds from operations (FFO) were $52.2 million, or $0.88 per share in Q1 1997 vs $33.8 million or $0.72 per share in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Equity Residential Properties Trust.</p>
